title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/folder:open
catalog: GUI command
target: folder:open
summary: Open a frequently and recently used folder (files / children / subtree)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shipped ``commands.js``

!! Default keys

* ``b g c`` → ``folder:open children new``
* ``b g d`` → ``folder:open files new``
* ``b g t`` → ``folder:open subtree new``
* ``g c`` → ``folder:open children here``
* ``g d`` → ``folder:open files here``
* ``g t`` → ``folder:open subtree here``
* ``i g c`` → ``folder:open children here``
* ``i g d`` → ``folder:open files here``
* ``i g t`` → ``folder:open subtree here``
* ``w g c`` → ``folder:open children other``
* ``w g d`` → ``folder:open files other``
* ``w g t`` → ``folder:open subtree other``
